    "Device authorized: it signs in to your account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appareil autorisé : il se connecte à ton compte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Direct": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Direct"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download on the server PC": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télécharger sur le PC serveur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a row to move it. A library’s row shows what was added to it lately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fais glisser une rangée pour la déplacer. La rangée d’une bibliothèque montre ce qui vient d’y être ajouté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "E%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E%@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "É%@"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "An episode's number: É5 in French"
    },
    "Each series’ TheTVDB id, for its list of episodes. No name or picture from TheTVDB is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’identifiant TheTVDB de chaque série, pour sa liste d’épisodes. Ni nom, ni image de TheTVDB ne sont gardés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earlier": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus tôt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End of the episode": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fin de l’épisode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter an http:// or https:// address, without credentials in it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saisis une adresse http:// ou https://, sans identifiants dans l’adresse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the 6-digit code the device to connect shows. It will open your account: only authorize a device you can see.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tape le code à 6 chiffres affiché par l’appareil à connecter. Il ouvrira ton compte : n’autorise qu’un appareil que tu vois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter your Jellyfin server’s address, for example 192.168.1.20.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indique l’adresse de ton serveur Jellyfin, par exemple 192.168.1.20."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Episodes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Épisodes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every detail (SECURITY.md)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les détails (SECURITY.md)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything that goes out on the network, and how to stop it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout ce qui part sur le réseau, et comment l’arrêter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depuis cet appareil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From your Jellyfin server": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depuis ton serveur Jellyfin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub, where Mira is published.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub, où Mira est publiée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a group · %@ · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En groupe · %1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "The group's button over the tabs: En groupe · Groupe de mira · mira et Marc"
    },
    "In Jellyfin’s dashboard, Libraries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans le tableau de bord de Jellyfin, Bibliothèques."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Jellyfin’s dashboard, Plugins, Repositories.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans le tableau de bord de Jellyfin, Extensions, Dépôts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It goes on in the background as long as iOS lets it, otherwise when you open Mira again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ça continue en arrière-plan tant qu’iOS le permet, sinon quand tu rouvres Mira."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It plays here without a connection. Removed, it leaves this iPhone only: it stays on Jellyfin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il se lit ici sans connexion. Retiré, il ne quitte que cet iPhone : il reste sur Jellyfin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jellyfin doesn’t let this account download its videos. In Jellyfin, Dashboard → Users → this account, allow media downloads, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jellyfin ne laisse pas ce compte télécharger ses vidéos. Dans Jellyfin, Tableau de bord → Utilisateurs → ce compte, autorise le téléchargement des médias, puis réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jellyfin on your Tailscale network": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jellyfin sur ton réseau Tailscale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep on this iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder sur cet iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the season on this iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder la saison sur cet iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeping on this iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mise sur cet iPhone en cours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeping… %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mise sur l’iPhone… %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "last seen %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "vu pour la dernière fois %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus tard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Like the Tailscale app: your account, the device’s name, its system, its IP addresses and its public key. Videos stay end-to-end encrypted, no log is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comme l’app Tailscale : ton compte, le nom de l’appareil, son système, ses adresses IP et sa clé publique. Les vidéos restent chiffrées de bout en bout, aucun journal n’est envoyé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chercher à nouveau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking for Jellyfin on your Tailscale network…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recherche de Jellyfin sur ton réseau Tailscale…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira can’t reach Jellyfin: it goes on as soon as it can.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira ne joint pas Jellyfin : ça reprend dès que possible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira extension updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mises à jour de l’extension Mira"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira has no account, no ads, no analytics and no crash report sent on its own. Here is everything that goes out on the network, and how to stop it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mira n’a ni compte, ni publicité, ni mesure d’audience, ni rapport de plantage envoyé tout seul. Voici tout ce qui part sur le réseau, et comment l’arrêter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mira report": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rapport de Mira"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "miracinema.app (Mira’s list), GitHub (the app) and Apple.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "miracinema.app (la liste de Mira), GitHub (l’app) et Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Missing episodes (TheTVDB)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Épisodes manquants (TheTVDB)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Movies and episodes kept here play without a connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les films et épisodes gardés ici se lisent sans connexion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No device of your Tailscale network answers as Jellyfin on port 8096. Check that the PC with Jellyfin is on and connected to Tailscale, or type its Tailscale address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun appareil de ton réseau Tailscale ne répond comme Jellyfin sur le port 8096. Vérifie que le PC de Jellyfin est allumé et connecté à Tailscale, ou tape son adresse Tailscale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No device of your Tailscale network answers as this Jellyfin. Check that the PC with Jellyfin is on and connected to Tailscale.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun appareil de ton réseau Tailscale ne répond comme ce Jellyfin. Vérifie que le PC de Jellyfin est allumé et connecté à Tailscale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not enough room on this iPhone: it needs %@ more. Remove a title kept here or free up some space, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas assez de place sur cet iPhone : il manque %@. Retire un titre gardé ici ou libère de la place, puis réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not reachable now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Injoignable pour l’instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing in Mira: it’s AltStore.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien dans Mira : c’est AltStore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing on this iPhone yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien sur cet iPhone pour l’instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a movie or an episode, touch Keep on this iPhone: it plays here without a connection, even far from Jellyfin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur un film ou un épisode, touche Garder sur cet iPhone : il se lit ici sans connexion, même loin de Jellyfin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur cet iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once, with your Tailscale account. Your password stays on Tailscale’s page: Mira never sees it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une seule fois, avec ton compte Tailscale. Ton mot de passe reste sur la page de Tailscale : Mira ne le voit jamais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only if you installed it, at each library scan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seulement si tu l’as installée, à chaque analyse de la bibliothèque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only once turned on, when a title arrives or when you search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seulement une fois activés, quand un titre arrive ou quand tu cherches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only once turned on, while Mira is on screen or a title still plays.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seulement une fois activé, tant que Mira est à l’écran ou qu’un titre joue encore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Tailscale’s admin console": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir la console de Tailscale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenSubtitles and SubDL, through Jellyfin’s Mira extension.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenSubtitles et SubDL, par l’extension Mira de Jellyfin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Path to Jellyfin": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chemin vers Jellyfin"
          }
        }
